  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Assistance to Disaster-Affected Populations in East Sepik and Highlands Provinces in Papua New Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the European Civil Protection and Humanitarian Aid Operations&apos; small-scale tool, the International Organization for Migration is contributing to the alleviation of humanitarian needs in East Sepik and the Highlands provinces. This is carried out through the provision of shelter materials and essential items for people displaced by disasters, including ensuring people&#x2019;s access to sanitation and hygiene products, in consideration of protection mainstreaming and gender sensitivity principles.</narrative>
  </description>
